<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>K Graphix | Creative Graphic Design Studio</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="K Graphix is a creative graphic design studio in Port Harcourt, Nigeria. We design flyers, logos, banners, birthday graphics and brand identities.">

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0b12">

    <style>
        /* =========================
           GENERAL SETTINGS
        ========================= */

        :root {
            --bg: #0b0b12;
            --card: #151521;
            --purple: #9255ff;
            --purple-light: #b18aff;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --muted: #b5b5c5;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            scroll-padding-top: 90px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        button, input, textarea, select {
            font: inherit;
        }

        button, a {
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1120px, 90%);
            margin: auto;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 90px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .section-title span {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        .section-description {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 45px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 13px 23px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--purple);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--purple-light);
            color: #111;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border-color: var(--border);
            background: transparent;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--purple);
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        /* =========================
           NAVIGATION
        ========================= */

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(11,11,18,0.93);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        nav {
            min-height: 76px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.65rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover,
        .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            background: transparent;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* =========================
           HERO SECTION
        ========================= */

        .hero {
            min-height: 650px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 80% 35%,
                    rgba(146,85,255,0.18),
                    transparent 35%
                );
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: var(--purple-light);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5rem);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 570px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .hero-art {
            min-height: 390px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .art-card {
            width: min(100%, 360px);
            aspect-ratio: 0.85;
            border-radius: 22px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(145deg, #9255ff, #31205d 55%, #11111a);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 80px rgba(146,85,255,0.25);
            padding: 25px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transform: rotate(3deg);
        }

        .art-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 260px;
            height: 260px;
            border: 40px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 65px;
            right: -100px;
        }

        .art-card::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            bottom: -70px;
            left: -40px;
        }

        .art-label {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .art-title {
            position: absolute;
            left: 25px;
            bottom: 35px;
            z-index: 1;
            font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 0.95;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .art-title small {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .floating-badge {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 25px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .floating-badge span {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        /* =========================
           ABOUT
        ========================= */

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 45px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-visual {
            min-height: 340px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,
                    rgba(146,85,255,0.35),
                    transparent 45%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #202033, #11111a);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .about-visual strong {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
            color: var(--purple-light);
            letter-spacing: -4px;
        }

        .about-visual p {
            color: var(--muted);
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .about-text h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .about-text p {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .feature-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .feature-list li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .feature-list li::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: var(--purple-light);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        /* =========================
           SERVICES
        ========================= */

        .services {
            background: #0e0e17;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
            border-color: var(--purple);
        }

        .service-icon {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: rgba(146,85,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* =========================
           PORTFOLIO
        ========================= */

        .portfolio-filters {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            background: var(--card);
            color: var(--muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 9px 17px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .filter-btn:hover,
        .filter-btn.active {
            background: var(--purple);
            border-color: var(--purple);
            color: white;
        }

        .portfolio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .portfolio-item {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .portfolio-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .portfolio-item.hidden {
            display: none;
        }

        .portfolio-image {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .portfolio-image h3 {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
            line-height: 1.05;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .portfolio-image p {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .design-one {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #f7a83b, #c13a30);
        }

        .design-two {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #132c49, #2577a7);
        }

        .design-three {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #f3d6aa, #aa6c48);
            color: #29180f;
        }

        .design-four {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #40215f, #b14c9b);
        }

        .design-five {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #d6efdc, #4d9b76);
            color: #102c20;
        }

        .design-six {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #24242c, #686879);
        }

        .portfolio-info {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .portfolio-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .portfolio-info p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .portfolio-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        /* =========================
           PROCESS
        ========================= */

        .process {
            background: #0e0e17;
        }

        .process-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .process-step {
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--card);
        }

        .step-number {
            color: var(--purple-light);
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .process-step h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .process-step p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        /* =========================
           CONTACT
        ========================= */

        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
            gap: 35px;
        }

        .contact-details h3 {
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact-details > p {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .contact-card {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 17px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .contact-icon {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            background: rgba(146,85,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .contact-card h4 {
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .contact-card p,
        .contact-card a {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .contact-card a:hover {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        .contact-form {
            padding: 30px;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .contact-form h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        .form-group input,
        .form-group select,
        .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 13px;
            background: #0e0e17;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-group input:focus,
        .form-group select:focus,
        .form-group textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--purple);
        }

        .form-group textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .form-group select option {
            background: #151521;
        }

        .contact-form .btn {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .form-note {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================= */

        footer {
            background: #07070c;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 35px 0;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .footer-content p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--purple-light);
        }

        /* =========================
           WHATSAPP BUTTON
        ========================= */

        .whatsapp-float {
            position: fixed;
            right: 22px;
            bottom: 22px;
            z-index: 900;
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: #25D366;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .whatsapp-float:hover {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }

        /* =========================
           BACK TO TOP
        ========================= */

        .back-to-top {
            position: fixed;
            right: 27px;
            bottom: 95px;
            width: 43px;
            height: 43px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--card);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: none;
            z-index: 900;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .back-to-top.show {
            display: block;
        }

        /* =========================
           ANIMATIONS
        ========================= */

        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(22px);
            transition: opacity 0.65s ease, transform 0.65s ease;
        }

        .reveal.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* =========================
           RESPONSIVE DESIGN
        ========================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .nav-links {
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .hero-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr;
                gap: 25px;
            }

            .services-grid,
            .portfolio-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .process-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .section {
                padding: 65px 0;
            }

            nav {
                min-height: 70px;
            }

            .menu-toggle {
                display: block;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
                position: absolute;
                top: 70px;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;
                background: #101019;
                padding: 20px 5%;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 18px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            }

            .nav-links.open {
                display: flex;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: auto;
            }

            .hero-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 65px 0 45px;
            }

            .hero-art {
                min-height: 340px;
            }

            .art-card {
                width: min(85%, 300px);
            }

            .floating-badge {
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
            }

            .about-grid,
            .contact-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-visual {
                min-height: 270px;
            }

            .services-grid,
            .portfolio-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .portfolio-image {
                aspect-ratio: 1.1 / 1;
            }

            .form-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 0;
            }

            .contact-form {
                padding: 22px;
            }

            .footer-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .whatsapp-float {
                width: 52px;
                height: 52px;
                right: 15px;
                bottom: 15px;
            }

            .back-to-top {
                right: 20px;
                bottom: 80px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html {
                scroll-behavior: auto;
            }

            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            }

            .reveal {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->

    <header>
        <nav class="container" aria-label="Main navigation">

            <a href="#home" class="logo">
                K <span>GRAPHIX.</span>
            </a>

            <button class="menu-toggle"
                    id="menuToggle"
                    aria-label="Open navigation menu"
                    aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="navLinks">
                ☰
            </button>

            <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>

        </nav>
    </header>


    <main>

        <!-- HERO SECTION -->

        <section class="hero" id="home">
            <div class="container hero-content">

                <div class="hero-copy reveal">

                    <p class="eyebrow">Creative Design Studio</p>

                    <h1>
                        Ideas Made<br>
                        <span>Visual.</span>
                    </h1>

                    <p class="hero-text">
                        Welcome to K Graphix, where creativity meets
                        professional design. We transform your ideas into
                        eye-catching visuals that help your brand stand out.
                    </p>

                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <a href="#portfolio" class="btn btn-primary">
                            Explore Our Work →
                        </a>

                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">
                            Start a Project
                        </a>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="hero-art reveal" aria-label="K Graphix design artwork">

                    <div class="art-card">
                        <p class="art-label">CREATIVITY • DESIGN • IMPACT</p>

                        <div class="art-title">
                            K<br>GFX
                            <small>BE DIFFERENT.</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="floating-badge">
                        <span>✦</span> Designs That Speak
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->

        <section class="section" id="about">
            <div class="container about-grid">

                <div class="about-visual reveal">
                    <div>
                        <strong>K.</strong>
                        <p>CREATIVE THINKING</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="about-text reveal">

                    <p class="eyebrow">About K Graphix</p>

                    <h3>We Turn Your Ideas Into Creative Designs.</h3>

                    <p>
                        K Graphix is a graphic design brand dedicated to
                        producing creative, attractive and professional
                        visuals for individuals, businesses and organisations.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        From memorable logos to promotional flyers, we help
                        communicate your message through thoughtful design.
                        Every project is an opportunity to create something
                        unique.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Creative and original concepts</li>
                        <li>Professional visual presentation</li>
                        <li>Designs for personal and business use</li>
                        <li>Attention to detail</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">
                        Let's Work Together
                    </a>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- SERVICES SECTION -->

        <section class="section services" id="services">
            <div class="container">

                <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">
                    What We Do
                </p>

                <h2 class="section-title">
                    Our <span>Services</span>
                </h2>

                <p class="section-description">
                    Creative design solutions to help you promote your
                    business, celebrate special moments and build a strong
                    visual identity.
                </p>

                <div class="services-grid">

                    <article class="service-card reveal">
                        <div class="service-icon">🎨</div>
                        <h3>Flyer Design</h3>
                        <p>
                            Eye-catching promotional flyers for businesses,
